==Trivia==
*The [[Saradomin]] symbol on the [[Altar_(Saradomin)#Flipped|altar]] at [[Camelot]] is oriented the opposite way from most in the game. As this orientation is what would have been the norm in Medieval Europe, it is possible that this is a reference to Camelot's mythical origins.

